========================================
<%= String.upcase(@brand.name) %>
========================================

Welcome to <%= @brand.name %>! 👋

Hi <%= @email %>,

Thank you for signing up for <%= @brand.name %>! We're excited to have you on board.

To complete your registration and get started with our digital signage platform, please visit the following link:

<%= @signup_url %>

----------------------------------------

🔒 SECURITY NOTICE:
If you didn't create an account with <%= @brand.name %>, please ignore this email. This link will expire after use for your security.

----------------------------------------

<%= if @brand.support_url || @brand.support_email do %>Need help?
<%= if @brand.support_url do %>Visit our support center: <%= @brand.support_url %>
<% end %><%= if @brand.support_email do %>Contact us: <%= @brand.support_email %>
<% end %>
<% end %><%= @brand.copyright %>
<%= unless @brand.reply_to do %>
This is an automated message, please do not reply to this email.
<% end %>
========================================
